<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 6.8 points to 804.6 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 6.8 points to 804.6 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 6.8 points on Monday to 804.6, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Eight of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the energy index losing the most, down 24.6 points, or 2.58 percent, to 930.3 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
